# Build output. Cargo.lock is deliberately NOT here: it is committed, so CI
# resolves reproducibly and an unrelated pull request does not turn red because
# a transitive dependency published or was yanked. The library-crate default
# that excludes it is the single most likely thing to be copied in by mistake.
target/

# Working notes that belong to a machine and not to the crate.
*.local.*

# macOS
.DS_Store
